      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAPPINBARRA LADY (8) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 1609m at Bunbury, finishing second and just 1.2 metres from the winner. If the gaps come, she can go one better this time. LYCA FANTASY (3) has been racing well of late. Finished third at her latest appearance over 1609m at Bunbury, beaten 8 metres. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets some better types this time but she has the ability to test this field. ELBRUJA (9) was out of the money two runs ago then overcame a break to finish second, beaten a nose, over 2130m at Central Wheatbelt six days ago. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. Include in all top 4 combos. THUNDER WARRIOR (1) is worth some thought after his last-start fourth over 1609m at Bunbury on August 14. Include in all combos from the ace draw.",
